{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/327633-beholden-to-fate-your-ascended-storyteller-spoilers-characters","id":327633,"title":"Beholden To Fate-Your Ascended [Storyteller Spoilers] Characters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-01T20:34:25-08:00","id":327633,"title":"Beholden To Fate-Your Ascended [Storyteller Spoilers] Characters","content":"Let's be honest. With the release of the Book of the Deceived and the distinction between the Arisen's and the Deceived's Mentaar, some of you have been plotting on making a Deceived counterpart to Heretic in Apotheosis. Hell, I'm planning a story around creating one sooner or later, and that might be next semester.<br /> <br /> So, let's cut to the chase-tell me about the characters you would create to become one of the Fatewalkers, the Ascended Deceived.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T04:54:32-08:00","id":328052,"title":"","content":"This thread makes me unreasonably happy. I'm watching intently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4248-nephilpal","name":"Nephilpal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4248_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T07:59:18-08:00","id":328207,"title":"","content":"I will definitely write something for this thread when I've finished my grad school papers.<br /> <br /> Tentative title is 'The Bodhisattva', as they linger in the 2012 Sothic Turn to serve as teacher.<br /> <br /> Also this: <a href=\"http://www.fodian.net/world/cundi/18a/Cundi7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.fodian.net/world/cundi/18a/Cundi7.jpg</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","user":"Aiden","date":". 12-02-2014, 11:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T10:11:15-08:00","id":328359,"title":"","content":"Aiden, I based the ascended Deceived in part based on the Wu'tian from Mummy: the Resurrection, so your Eastern imagery is spot on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4248-nephilpal","name":"Nephilpal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4248_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T10:37:58-08:00","id":328399,"title":"","content":"It makes sense! Their version of henet is essentially Nirvana if you could come back from time to time to do things (albeit not by your own will).<br /> <br /> I also had this vague idea in my head that Fate can pretty much ignore causality in deploying a Deceived who has undergone the Mentaar, so it is entirely possible in the course of a Descent for a Deceived to meet themselves from a distant aeon which they have not yet experienced.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T11:08:39-08:00","id":328457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/327633-beholden-to-fate-your-ascended-storyteller-spoilers-characters?p=328399#post328399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also had this vague idea in my head that Fate can pretty much ignore causality in deploying a Deceived who has undergone the Mentaar, so it is entirely possible in the course of a Descent for a Deceived to meet themselves from a distant aeon which they have not yet experienced.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds like an Affinity, not something that would just happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4248-nephilpal","name":"Nephilpal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4248_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T11:16:09-08:00","id":328465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nephilpal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/327633-beholden-to-fate-your-ascended-storyteller-spoilers-characters?p=328457#post328457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That sounds like an Affinity, not something that would just happen.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But it's also not something impossible, you're saying.<br /> <br /> That's the important part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T13:50:54-08:00","id":328589,"title":"","content":"Spend 1 Willpower to travel back in time.<br /> <br /> Actually, now that I think about it, it doesn't sound that unreasonable. It'll give a new spin on historical games or utilization of <b>Sothis Ascends</b>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nephilpal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/327633-beholden-to-fate-your-ascended-storyteller-spoilers-characters?p=328359#post328359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aiden, I based the ascended Deceived in part based on the Wu'tian from Mummy: the Resurrection, so your Eastern imagery is spot on.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty unfamiliar with the cWoD <b>Mummy</b> but I'm interested in seeing how the nWoD version contains various homages or shout-outs to the older one. Can you share anything else you had in mind between the Wu'tian and Ascended Deceived?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T13:57:14-08:00","id":328608,"title":"","content":"More like &quot;Only a Deceived who has achieved Apotheosis can manifest this Affinity. Whenever Fate sends the mummy into a new Descent, it may insert the character at any point in time as well as space. Fate generally does not place the same mummy at intersecting points in time so that he may encounter himself, but it is possible.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'm spitballing and I'd have to run anything like that past CAS. I'm just saying it seems reasonable to me as long as it's totally outside of player control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4248-nephilpal","name":"Nephilpal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4248_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T14:04:19-08:00","id":328613,"title":"","content":"That seems perfectly reasonable to me. After all, Fate didn't have these humanoid abomination troubleshooters in the past, but now it does. What is really going to stop the true cosmic order from enforcing itself retroactively?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T14:42:51-08:00","id":328629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nephilpal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/327633-beholden-to-fate-your-ascended-storyteller-spoilers-characters?p=328608#post328608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More like &quot;Only a Deceived who has achieved Apotheosis can manifest this Affinity. Whenever Fate sends the mummy into a new Descent, it may insert the character at any point in time as well as space. Fate generally does not place the same mummy at intersecting points in time so that he may encounter himself, but it is possible.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mind you, I'm spitballing and I'd have to run anything like that past CAS. I'm just saying it seems reasonable to me as long as it's totally outside of player control.</div> </div> </div> </div>IF, however, that's true, I can just skip hassle and just have a Fatewalker(That's what I'm calling it from now on).<br /> <br /> I mean, I still plan on having that game, but I can use the character ascended regardless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T09:40:52-08:00","id":371140,"title":"","content":"I've been busy plotting for a Descent game, but I'm coming back around to this as a player has pretty much written a destiny with the Deceived on accident. So, anyone have characters yet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T14:05:18-08:00","id":371441,"title":"","content":"I just ran my first session of Mummy ever, which had my only player trying to understand how the shuankhsen function if they don't serve the Judges. She wants to slip her leash already.<br /> <br /> Soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T16:32:13-08:00","id":371528,"title":"","content":"My own decision to keep the Deceived scarce in my game means that the only Deceived in the city are player characters, not NPCs.<br /> <br /> I may introduce a servant of Fate in order to detail the Apotheosis option at a later date, but it's not really on my mind at the moment. Both characters are having a lot of fun playing up their Temakh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"